Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["TagSelectedCell", "ObjectName",
 CellID->138023749,ExpressionUUID->"7378ec44-7c3f-4468-858d-4f26a054707a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"39ef8682-5481-4bd3-aa2b-6072fd2f802a"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["TagSelectedCell",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:WolframInstitute/MathNotebook/ref/TagSelectedCell"], 
   RowBox[{"[", "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "ae42210c-7b0e-4cb1-8a6d-47b22513bed6"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "assigns a cell tag to the selected cell, for use as a citation anchor."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->468964072,ExpressionUUID->"078ed8c4-8076-4735-a1b5-b54e6c0cdf22"],

Cell["\<\
Acts on the current selection in the front end. There is no result to \
compute, and the function does nothing in a kernel with no front end.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->222995784,ExpressionUUID->"f9abfca8-674d-4e71-99ef-55cb07a6ec5b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The tag is what ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
   "InsertCitation", 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/MathNotebook/ref/InsertCitation", 
    "https://reference.wolfram.com/language/WolframInstitute/MathNotebook/ref/\
InsertCitation.html"},
   "TextRefLink",
   DisplayFunction->(TagBox[
     ButtonBox[
      StyleBox[#, ShowStringCharacters -> True, FontFamily -> 
       "Source Sans Pro"], 
      BaseStyle -> {"Link", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
          RGBColor[0.02, 0.286, 0.651], 
          RGBColor[0.2823, 0.6666, 0.949]]}, ButtonData -> #2, ContentPadding -> 
      False], 
     MouseAppearanceTag["LinkHand"]]& )]],ExpressionUUID->
  "fa77893e-4c87-42fb-8af7-2f596a89e9d6"],
 " resolves. A numbered environment is cited by its number and a Reference \
cell by its tag, so the tag is the anchor in both cases."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->407828382,ExpressionUUID->"fd6f2961-937a-404a-b0f8-f1fb736ef147"],

Cell["\<\
A citation to a tag that no cell carries renders as the tag in brackets \
rather than failing, so a mistyped tag is visible in the document rather than \
silent.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->916377647,ExpressionUUID->"8e290ae4-fc51-4fc2-bf5b-9529f040c019"]
}, Open  ]],

